      },
      {
        "question": "What is element compatibility?",
        "answer": "It compares Fire, Earth, Air, and Water to talk about pace and needs. It does not mean some elements are automatically right or wrong."
      }
    ],
    "reading": [
      {
        "href": "https://blog.oiyo.net/en/western-astrology-vs-saju-comparison/",
        "label": "Astrology vs Saju",
        "desc": "Compare Western signs with East Asian saju."
